zj/thumb/1/17/t2sxbl6j0mz9o3opp6thw0rparqtugj.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%B2%BE%E7%A1%AE%E5%B0%84%E5%87%BB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/17/t2sxbl6j0mz9o3opp6thw0rparqtugj.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%B2%BE%E7%A1%AE%E5%B0%84%E5%87%BB.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/17/t2sxbl6j0mz9o3opp6thw0rparqtugj.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />精确射击\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>远程、对单位、平射\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）单体攻击，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">130%</font>伤害。攻击前，对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×闪避\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×闪避</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/02/m4gv8o4dpxzc7r9lpuzb4xhyp1ivq98.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/02/m4gv8o4dpxzc7r9lpuzb4xhyp1ivq98.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8B%99%E5%87%BB%E6%95%99%E5%AE%98%E2%80%9C%E6%9A%97%E8%8A%92%E2%80%9D\" title=\"角色图鉴库/狙击教官“暗芒”\"><img alt=\"头像 狙击教官“暗芒”.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/97/kxqwh28co4c2weqqtmr0nhmgmar1d72.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">狙击教官“暗芒”</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%B3%95%E5%8D%A1%E5%B0%94\" title=\"角色图鉴库/法卡尔\"><img alt=\"头像 法卡尔.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/5f/edd7ogfafskm4avvao89okpjxng4fdx.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">法卡尔</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%B3%95%E5%8D%A1%E5%B0%94%C2%B7%E5%8D%AB%E5%9B%BD%E4%B9%8B%E7%AE%AD\" title=\"角色图鉴库/法卡尔·卫国之箭\"><img alt=\"头像 法卡尔·卫国之箭.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/969ec2sedgoq322bvcnkhjbj0jjpngk.png\" de